          "item": "piranport:f4f_wildcat",
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "飞机放飞前要完成整备：加满航空燃料 + 装好挂载弹药。提示上会红字标出缺油/缺挂载。",
            "en_us": "An aircraft must be serviced before launch: full aviation fuel plus its ordnance mounted. The tooltip flags fuel/payload shortages in red."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 2.6, 2.5],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        },
        {
          "type": "create_item_entity",
          "pos": [1.5, 3.5, 2.5],
          "motion": [0.0, -0.03, 0.0],
          "count": 1,
          "item": "piranport:fuel",
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "create_item_entity",
          "pos": [3.5, 3.5, 2.5],
          "motion": [0.0, -0.03, 0.0],
          "count": 1,
          "item": "piranport:aerial_bomb",
          "attachKeyFrame": false
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 90,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "背包里备好航空燃料和挂载物——轰炸机吃航弹，鱼雷机吃航空鱼雷，战斗机不需要挂载。",
            "en_us": "Keep aviation fuel and ordnance in your inventory — bombers take aerial bombs, torpedo planes take aerial torpedoes, fighters need no payload."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 3.6, 2.5],
          "color": "input",
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 100
        },
        {
          "type": "indicate_success",
          "blockPos": [2, 1, 2],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "当前版本中，变身后手持飞机，按装填键（默认 R）启动整备；补给不足时无法启动。",
            "en_us": "In this version, transform, hold the aircraft and press the reload key (R by default) to start servicing. Insufficient supplies prevent it from starting."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 1.5, 2.5],
          "color": "green",
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reload_bar",
      "title": {
        "zh_cn": "读条结算规则",
        "en_us": "How the Servicing Bar Resolves"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "type": "show_structure",
          "structure": "ponderer:basic"
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 20
        },
        {
          "type": "create_item_entity",
          "item": "piranport:f4f_wildcat",
          "pos": [2, 1, 2]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "整备读条结束时才扣除所需燃料桶和挂载物，飞机油满且挂载就绪后才能放飞。",
            "en_us": "Required fuel and ordnance are consumed when servicing completes. Full fuel and the required payload are needed to launch."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 2.2, 2.5],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "读条期间切换物品或受伤不会取消整备；结算时补给不足则不能完成。",
            "en_us": "Switching items or taking damage does not cancel servicing; it cannot complete if supplies are missing at settlement."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 2.8, 2.5],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        },
        {
          "type": "indicate_success",
          "blockPos": [2, 1, 2],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "整备完成后，手持飞机右键主动放飞；燃油耗尽会返航，回收后再补油。",
            "en_us": "Once ready, hold the aircraft and right-click to launch. It returns when fuel runs out and needs refueling after recovery."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 1.5, 2.5],
          "color": "green",
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        }
      ]
    }
